---
layout: layouts/base.njk
wrap: wrap-narrow
---
{%- from "partials/bot-mark.njk" import botMark -%}
<div class="phead"><h1>Russian disinformation in AI chatbots: {{ profile.name }}</h1>
  <p class="plead">{{ profile.bots | length }} assistants tested in {{ profile.language | languageName }},
    run of <time datetime="{{ profile.run.collected_at | isoDate }}">{{ profile.run.collected_at | displayDate }}</time>.
    <b>{{ profile.confirmed }} of {{ profile.bots | length }}</b> repeat a documented false claim here often
    enough that the interval excludes zero, on {{ profile.persona }} news-style questions.
    {%- if profile.note %} {{ profile.note }}{% endif %}</p></div>

<h2 id="assistants" style="margin:0 0 12px">{{ 'section.assistantsHere' | t }}</h2>
<div class="panel"><table>
  <caption class="visually-hidden">Repeat rate, contamination and refusals per assistant in this market, on news-style questions</caption>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">{{ 'col.chatbot' | t }}</th><th scope="col" class="num">{{ 'col.repeatRate' | t }}</th>
    <th scope="col" class="num">{{ 'col.contamination' | t }}</th><th scope="col" class="num">Refused</th>
    <th scope="col" class="num">Searched</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {%- for row in profile.bots %}
    <tr data-persona="{{ profile.persona }}">
      <td class="cl"><span class="markcell">{{ botMark(logos, row.key, "sm", true) }}{% if row.url %}<a href="{{ row.url | url }}">{{ row.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ row.name }}{% endif %}</span></td>
      <td class="num"><span class="cellstat{% if row.repeat_rate.low_n %} lown{% endif %}">{{ row.repeat_rate.rate | rate }}<small>{{ row.repeat_rate.ci | ciLabel }} &middot; n={{ row.repeat_rate.n }}</small></span></td>
      <td class="num"><span class="cellstat{% if row.contamination_rate.low_n %} lown{% endif %}">{{ row.contamination_rate.rate | rate }}<small>n={{ row.contamination_rate.n }}</small></span></td>
      <td class="num"><span class="cellstat">{{ row.dodge_rate.rate | rate }}<small>n={{ row.dodge_rate.n }}</small></span></td>
      <td class="num" style="color:var(--dim)">{{ row.n - row.counts.dodge }} answers</td></tr>
  {%- endfor %}
  </tbody></table></div>
<p class="note">Every figure is the {{ profile.persona }} news-style persona in this market only: personas
  are never averaged and markets are never merged. A market that looks clean because assistants refuse is
  not the same as one where they answer and get it right, which is why refusals are shown beside the rate.
  Per-persona figures are on each assistant's own profile.</p>

{%- if profile.claims | length %}
<h2 id="claims" style="margin:36px 0 12px">Claims recorded in {{ profile.name }}</h2>
<div class="panel"><table>
  <caption class="visually-hidden">Published claim reports recorded in answers served to this market, which assistants repeated them here, and what we have done about them</caption>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">Claim</th><th scope="col">Verdict</th><th scope="col">Repeated here by</th>
    <th scope="col">Countermeasure</th><th scope="col" class="num">Updated</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {%- for r in profile.claims %}
    <tr><th scope="row" style="font-weight:400"><a href="{{ ('/registry/' + r.slug + '/') | url }}">{{ r.label }}</a>
      <span style="color:var(--dimmer)">{{ r.claimKey }}</span></th>
      <td><span class="badge {{ r.verdict | verdictClass }}">{{ r.verdict | verdictLabel }}</span></td>
      <td>{% if r.repeatedBy | length %}<div class="stack">{% for b in r.repeatedBy %}{{ botMark(logos, b.key, "sm") }}{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<span style="color:var(--dimmer)" title="No assistant repeated this claim in this market">&mdash;</span>{% endif %}</td>
      <td>{% if r.cmStatus %}<span class="chip {{ 'ok' if r.cmStatus in ['responded','closed'] else ('wait' if r.cmStatus == 'submitted' else '') }}"><span class="dot"></span>{{ r.cmStatus | statusLabel }}</span>{% else %}<span style="color:var(--dimmer)">&mdash;</span>{% endif %}</td>
      <td class="num" style="color:var(--dim)">{% if r.updated %}<time datetime="{{ r.updated | isoDate }}">{{ r.updated | shortDate }}</time>{% endif %}</td></tr>
  {%- endfor %}
  </tbody></table></div>
<p class="note">&ldquo;Repeated here by&rdquo; is any assistant that stated this claim as fact in this market, across every question type. The countermeasure is the furthest step taken on this claim; a draft is not yet sent.</p>
{%- endif %}

{%- if profile.partners | length %}
<h2 id="partners" style="margin:36px 0 12px">{{ 'section.localPartners' | t }}</h2>
<div class="prose" style="max-width:none"><p>We share findings for this market with
  {% for p in profile.partners %}{{ p }}{% if not loop.last %}{% if loop.revindex0 == 1 %} and {% else %}, {% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p></div>
{%- endif %}
<div style="height:40px"></div>
